===Noun===
{{en-noun|neurohypophyses}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} The [[posterior]] [[lobe]] of the [[pituitary gland]], responsible for the [[release]] of [[oxytocin]] and [[antidiuretic hormone]] (ADH), also called [[vasopressin]].

